        },
        {
          "text": "Lino oyo mwanakazi Elisha ngwaakabusizya mwana mufu, Elisha wakamwaambila kuti, Nyamuka, uinke webo abasikamukowa bako, kuyookala­ kala kufumbwa nkumujana busena, nkaambo Jehova ulaleta inzala, nkabela iyooba munyika myaka iili musanu aibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwanakazi wakanyamuka, wacita mbubonya mbuli muntu wa-Leza mbwaakamwaambila. Wakainka, walo abasikamukowa bakwe, kuyookala munyika yaba-Filisti myaka iili musanu aibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo myaka iili musanu aibili niyakamana, mwanakazi wakaboola kuzwa kunyika yaba-Filisti, wasika kumwami kuzoobuzya Iŋanda yakwe amyuunda yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.5.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bam 5:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mwami wakali kwaambaula a-Gehazi mulanda wamuntu wa-Leza. Wakati, Kondaambila milimo yoonse mipati Elisha njacita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bam 4:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo wakali kwaambila mwami mbwaakabusya muntu mufu, nkabela mpoonya awo oyo mwanakazi ngwaakabusizya mwana wakwe mufu wakasika kuyoolilila mwami aaŋanda yakwe amyuunda yakwe. Lino Gehazi wakati, O mwami simalelo wangu, ngooyu mwanakazi, alimwi ngooyu mwana wakwe Elisha ngwaakabusya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami naakamubuzya, mwanakazi wakamwaambila makani. Nkabela mwami wakamupa similimo umwi, wamulailila kuti, Kopilusizya mwanakazi imbono zyakwe zyoonse, amicelo yoonse yamyuunda yakwe kuzwa kubuzuba obo naakainka akusikila sunu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
