            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwami wakaambila Hazaeli kuti, Tolelela acipo, ukacinge muntu wa-Leza, ukabuzye ijwi lya-Jehova kumulomo wakwe, tuzibe kuti na ndilapona kubulwazi obu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Hazaeli wakanyamuka kuyoomucinga, watolelela inkamele zili makumi one ziyumwide cipo cazintu zibotu zyoonse zyamu-Damasko. Nkabela naakasika nkwaakabede, wakaima kunembo lyakwe, wati, Mwanaako Beni-hadadi mwami wa-Aramu wandituma kulinduwe, wabuzya kuti, Sa ndilapona kubulwazi obu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha wakamwaambila kuti, Koya, ukamwaambile kuti, Kupona ulapona. Anukuti Jehova wandaambila kuti ncobeni ulafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
