        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Hazaeli wakabuzya kuti, Ino nkaambonzi nolila, mwami? Wakavuwa kuti, Nkaambo kakuti ndizi bubi mboyoocitila bana ba-Israyeli. Minzi yabo miyumu uyooisaala, bakubusi babo babotu uyoobajazya ipanga, twana twabo uyootupwayaula, abanakazi babo baminsi uyoobapandula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
