                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Hazaeli wakati, Ma! Sa ndi mubwa ndemulanda wako? Nkacite buti malweza aali boobo? Elisha wakati, Jehova wandi tondezya kuti nduwe uyooba mwami wa-Aramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo naakazwa kuli-Elisha, wakasika kulisimalelo aakwe. Wakabuzya kuti, Ino Elisha wakwaambilanzi? Wakavuwa kuti, Wandaambila kuti kupona uyoopona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nibwakaca, wakabweza ingubo, wainika mumaanzi, waiyanika ameso aakwe mane wafwa. Aboobo Hazaeli wakalya bwami bwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
